    "description": "A fan-made mod for Minecraft inspired by Dedsafio 3, a popular hardcore Minecraft series. The goal is to replicate and integrate unique mechanics from the series into the game, providing fans with an immersive experience that captures the intense survival challenges of Dedsafio 3. The mod aims to faithfully recreate key features and elements that define the series' gameplay, such as specialized difficulty settings, unique progression systems, and any exclusive items or abilities seen in the episodes."
